<BaseLayout title="Privacy — JuggleCast website" description="Privacy information for the static JuggleCast project website and optional JuggleCast Pro licence requests."><section class="page container"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy</h1><p>This static project website contains no analytics, tracking service, advertising, account system or cookies.</p></header><div class="prose"><h2>Website hosting</h2><p>The site is prepared for GitHub Pages. GitHub may process technical request information under its own policies. JuggleCast does not add browser storage or third-party runtime resources.</p><h2>Self-hosted Community operation</h2><p>Community starts and broadcasts without a mandatory remote licence-service request. The operator controls the host, media and service logs.</p><h2>Optional Pro licensing</h2><p>When explicitly configured, a request may include a licence identifier, JuggleCast version, installation identifier, requested entitlement and coarse platform metadata. It does not include media, playlists, Icecast secrets or listener data.</p><p>For the repository’s controlling statement, read <a href="https://github.com/chourmovs/FlowCast-Community/blob/main/PRIVACY.md">PRIVACY.md</a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
